[{"title":"秋夜宿郡斋书呈诸契厚","author":"陈煇","text":"淡云流月下空阶，此夕相随宿郡斋。\n疏竹高梧连夜榻，寒泉落木对秋崖。\n孤琴不用弹新曲，尊酒还同写旧怀。\n良会应须频潦到，谁言萍梗各天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33807,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翰林侍讲林环崇璧远示手教书以复之","author":"陈煇","text":"玉堂远念旧交疏，遥寄南天一写书。\n自是多情怜久别，应题飞翰慰閒居。\n雨中秋草迷山馆，天上春云覆石渠。\n不有故人频顾问，茂陵愁绝病相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33808,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饯别户部郎中林公致雍翰林典籍黄公约仲","author":"陈煇","text":"萧萧风雨送残秋，况复凄凉感别愁。\n粉署仙郎吟判袂，玉堂诗史解行舟。\n烟村夜火明沙岸，江郭晨钟起郡楼。\n不尽离情付流水，随君直到凤池头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33809,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇乡人","author":"陈煇","text":"臈月都城雪作花，相逢况复在天涯。\n云山自是增离恨，风物那堪近岁华。\n远渚断烟迷晓雁，长林落日集昏鸦。\n坐来笑问乡园事，喜道平安似到家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33810,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"陈煇","text":"危楼高架岳阳城，舣棹閒登豁远情。\n春雨波涛来几席，夜寒星斗挂檐楹。\n清游墨客琴樽美，飞步仙人剑佩轻。\n范相雄文誇绝代，气争光岳尚纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33811,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荏平马上口号简邵宪使党佥宪","author":"陈煇","text":"荏平云是古名封，地控高唐势独雄。\n百雉城荒秋雨后，几家门掩夕阳中。\n马周论议情何切，方朔诙谐赋独工。\n共是霜台骢马客，偶因怀古挹清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33812,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜听雪简参政郑公","author":"陈煇","text":"飘飘飞雪响檐楹，卧听书堂欲二更。\n映月未分窗外影，因风先送竹边声。\n乍凝霜叶依林下，恍讶寒松绕涧鸣。\n起坐披襟浑不寐，冰壶相对有馀清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33813,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永乐甲辰之秋岳阳方豸史佺按辔赤水偶得一联云云生石洞重阴合雨过峰峦积翠深索余足之因而赋此","author":"陈煇","text":"曙色濛濛结远林，半空鸟道挂危岑。\n云生石洞重阴合，雨过峰峦积翠深。\n揽辔观风询异俗，看山抚景动新吟。\n挥鞭笑指来时路，一道清风洒素襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33814,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣怀书寄诸愚仪倞攒","author":"陈煇","text":"懒看镜里发如丝，病起庭前觉事非。\n满地绿阴芳草遍，一帘红雨落花飞。\n閒来却笑材无补，别久仍嫌信到稀。\n政尔望乡心切处，杜鹃唤道不如归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33815,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪严都运重游平远台同林文则和严韵","author":"陈煇","text":"肩舆同上石林间，又得追陪到竹关。\n碧树清泉岩畔路，白云黄叶寺前山。\n兴来吟咏俄成什，老得辞归半是閒。\n雅爱相忘频潦倒，不妨重藉石苔斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33816,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发南屿桥","author":"陈煇","text":"江水白于雪，溪沙皓如月。\n扁舟浦口来，落日桥南发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33817,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得旷如楼送人之京","author":"陈煇","text":"高楼邻青云，虚爽复幽绝。\n凉风下书帷，似与离人别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33818,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜访戴","author":"陈煇","text":"一夜风雪寒，扁舟独乘兴。\n未见同心人，前溪兴应尽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33819,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云寺晨钟","author":"陈煇","text":"古寺白云中，疏钟逗林樾。\n凌晨数杵来，敲落山上月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33820,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪毬花","author":"陈煇","text":"一枝晴雪带轻寒，正是梁园春未阑。\n恍怫玉环初梦觉，香魂犹向月中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33821,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘潭雨色","author":"陈煇","text":"凝烟积翠淡如流，万里苍茫一望秋。\n坐对湘潭归棹晚，乱山残雨送猿愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33822,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"陈煇","text":"每爱横枝醉里看，满林风雪浩漫漫。\n数声残笛知何处，吹落空江片月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33823,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳","author":"陈煇","text":"空塘流水浸长条，细雨疏烟拂灞桥。\n羌笛数声人不见，春风斜系木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33824,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧牛图","author":"陈煇","text":"日暮桃林风雨寒，数声长啸下空山。\n草深行径无归路，却望清溪沙上还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33825,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"陈煇","text":"散帙看书对碧山，浮云流水与心閒。\n坐来不觉东林夕，月上前溪钓艇还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33826,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄葵花","author":"陈煇","text":"芳姿曾映羽人冠，仙掌擎来玉露寒。\n金粉只今成寂寞，唯馀向日寸心丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33827,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏白鸥","author":"陈煇","text":"江上群鸥亦有情，浮沈荡漾似轻萍。\n晓来推却篷窗视，惊落前溪雪满汀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33828,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿福泉寺书与?上人","author":"陈煇","text":"蜀僧出世在空门，心迹超然离垢氛。\n欲问安禅最幽处，一潭秋月半山云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33829,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"环翠楼","author":"吴实","text":"胜地留佳赏，楼台亦壮哉。\n群峰连海岱，真境接蓬莱。\n捲幔清辉入，凭栏爽气来。\n虚明澄霁景，潇洒轶浮埃。\n赋为登临作，怀因眺望开。\n丹岩明向席，空翠落衔杯。\n井干多陈迹，齐云半绿苔。\n多君清致在，何日共徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33830,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"养拙斋","author":"吴实","text":"大朴本无物，淳风轶唐虞。\n居巢与处穴，此外将焉图。\n世道日沦降，人心良亦殊。\n非徒徇雕采，巧伪相萦纡。\n夫子抱真性，乃在玄牝初。\n持心远矫亢，应物随空虚。\n直道行若拙，正言谋恒疏。\n仪秦笑周孔，此道彼为迂。\n怡然养吾真，天命其何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33831,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得富春山送人归闽","author":"吴实","text":"君不见富春山，富春山色行人看。\n层峦叠嶂带江渚，垂萝鸟道青漫漫。\n钓台百尺凌空险，石磴萦纡紫苔掩。\n芳草洲前翠欲流，夕阳渡口晴如染。\n羊裘钓叟今何在，千古行人增感慨。\n不见高风动客星，空馀濑水流东海。\n今日山前歌送君，明朝山下便离群。\n片帆直指桐江过，薄暮猿声那忍闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33832,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得瓜步寒潮送董教授之扬州","author":"吴实","text":"君不见秦淮瓜步通扬子，潮去潮来几今古。\n薄暮西风海气寒，潮音半入淮边树。\n芳草矶头望转平，夕阳渡口带江城。\n几回贾客惊残梦，多少离人恨别情。\n广文官舍瓜洲渡，山水依依最深处。\n一铎遥从海上闻，片帆直指潮头去。\n潮头东望正迢迢，此别心知两地遥。\n他时无恨相思意，落尽寒江半夜潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33833,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"编脩陈果之话别","author":"吴实","text":"火云六月腾赤霄，人间大地皆炎歊。\n连峰飞鸟不容越，君行别我如旋飙。\n知君久作家林别，堂上双亲鬓成雪。\n九重诏许暂承欢，千里驰驱不知热。\n我家桑梓旧连阴，夙昔交情最独深。\n十载同吟泮池水，有时共醉东溪林。\n青霄高步君先着，愧我年来尚萧索。\n离别长怀夜月吟，故情不道秋云薄。\n君自长才意气豪，桂林先得一枝高。\n玉堂天上魁黄甲，金马门中赐锦袍。\n伊予蹇劣知何用，也学云霄逐鹓凤。\n积水长天恨远心，青山故国悬空梦。\n玉堂相见即成欢，却念人生会合难。\n更无儿女分离态，但作家林醉里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33834,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧官归闽","author":"吴实","text":"万古西来教，名僧不世传。\n一官初佩印，四果独宗禅。\n衲挂峰前雨，杯浮海上烟。\n化城归去好，此会是何年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33835,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"带湖别墅","author":"吴实","text":"何地最清幽，飞轩瞰碧流。\n倾杯鱼鸟醉，捲幔水云浮。\n夜月凌鲛室，凉风入雀舟。\n兴来濯缨袂，天地等蜉蝣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33836,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹林书舍","author":"吴实","text":"别构宜清赏，翛翛竹满林。\n秋风疑凤舞，春雨讶龙吟。\n翠色全侵席，凉声半在琴。\n悬知君子操，共结岁寒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33837,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虎溪三笑","author":"吴实","text":"远公三笑地，陶陆是同流。\n明月清溪晚，凉风碧树秋。\n高怀轶今古，馀韵出林丘。\n自愧牵缨冕，宁同莲社游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33838,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙溪书室","author":"吴实","text":"闻说藏书屋，翛然趣不穷。\n溪光摇几席，树色隐房栊。\n洗砚春流墨，吹藜夜火红。\n庭前有芳草，生意得无同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松轩","author":"吴实","text":"直干凌霜古，清辉似草堂。\n倚栏苍雪冷，捲㡢翠云凉。\n向日秋停盖，和风晚奏簧。\n期君贞节操，持此到岩廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠考满椽","author":"吴实","text":"简牍贤劳日，曾闻干办声。\n九年今奏最，三语早知名。\n日照金门近，风传禁漏清。\n圣朝多雨露，行矣被恩荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠百长还营","author":"吴实","text":"飞将百夫前，龙韬久在边。\n雕弓胡月满，宝剑汉星悬。\n朔雪双旌度，西风疋马旋。\n承平无用武，醉向酒家眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿太湖山寺","author":"吴实","text":"一骑白云深，投鞭入远林。\n断霞将夕照，归鸟下幽岑。\n说法窥禅性，焚香静客心。\n空门聊一寄，明发又骎骎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月初一到和州府家城驿","author":"吴实","text":"昨日尚馀春，兹晨夏火新。\n麦风吟短帽，梅雨湿轻尘。\n芳草迷洲屿，垂杨暗渡津。\n途中惊岁月，王事未回轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送道官归","author":"吴实","text":"久辞尘迹几经年，楼阁中天蔼瑞烟。\n玉陛到来朝圣主，铜章归去领群仙。\n素鸾声远云连佩，白鹤秋横月在船。\n想到玄关多胜事，春风瑶草满芝田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送典幕闽中之任","author":"吴实","text":"宦游何处醉离觞，疋马南行去路长。\n越国潮声空外暝，秦淮树色雁边凉。\n行看绿水芙蓉美，坐识丹山荔子香。\n自古闽中无胜事，好凭歌咏赞琴堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分得九仙观送林信","author":"吴实","text":"丹丘琳馆倚崔嵬，灵境清都世外开。\n三岛霞光凌日月，九霄云影接楼台。\n道人玉骨壶中蜕，仙客瑶笙鹤上来。\n君去登临多胜槩，秋风偏醉葛洪杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中怀陈马二翰林","author":"吴实","text":"二月山城暖正融，桃花开尽杏花红。\n朋游零落春风后，客况凄凉暮雨中。\n闽海几年谁寄雁，淮山千里独乘骢。\n玉堂蓬阁如天上，此日怀人思不穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"吴实","text":"泗上高台旧汉封，昔人曾上此歌风。\n咸阳鹿去雄图尽，芒砀龙归帝业空。\n断碣古苔寒雨积，危基低树夕阳红。\n客游到此堪乘兴，醉把金尊送落鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜城","author":"吴实","text":"芜城自古盛繁华，玉辇巡游炀帝家。\n旧业消沈馀郡郭，青山迢递长桑麻。\n古堤尚有亡隋柳，后苑终无废汴花。\n行客登临多纵醉，百年兴废谩空嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄池景大校官","author":"吴实","text":"旅食京华又一年，怀君何处独凄然。\n故人零落知谁在，独客暌离祇自怜。\n残叶晚风惊远听，古梅寒月对愁眠。\n旧时鹤岭閒吟客，长忆风流剡曲船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得龙江晚棹送陈廷嘉","author":"吴实","text":"龙江南下正茫茫，晚棹烟波万里长。\n一叶渐看飞极浦，片帆遥见逐斜阳。\n凫鸥起处潮头入，兰蕊香时水气凉。\n却羡故人从此别，若为归兴满沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿英武城遇雨有怀京南知己","author":"吴实","text":"解鞍日暮宿山城，无那西风送雨声。\n漏远不闻宵柝警，馆荒惟对夜灯明。\n衾依古箦吟边冷，叶响虚窗梦不成。\n遥想江南知己别，相思多少故人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯应制","author":"吴实","text":"元夕春回不夜天，鳌峰高耸御筵前。\n琼花满缀蓬壶树，玉蕊平开太华莲。\n万井笙歌来锦绣，五云楼阁俨神仙。\n小臣何幸蒙恩赐，恭祝皇图亿万年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还乡","author":"吴实","text":"五陵年少似君稀，何事还家赋式微。\n野水绿芜催解棹，断云残雨送行衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登石室山","author":"郭廑","text":"夙昔志幽寻，閒来即登历。\n天清海上秋，木落林间夕。\n琴樽集华缨，歌吟坐台石。\n醉归觅前途，暝岩起寒色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"台江宴集分得料字","author":"郭廑","text":"沧洲趣不常，青云竟谁料。\n绿酒不尽欢，黄花向人笑。\n逸兴凌烟霞，忘机狎鸥鸟。\n此意谁与论，秋声动林表。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宴得谦家","author":"郭廑","text":"君家绝尘俗，爱客开华筵。\n飞觞对明月，痛饮凉风前。\n疏篁滴清露，夜色寒娟娟。\n此时固不乐，别后应徒然。\n酒酣忽浩荡，长啸凌青烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀鸣秋先生之京","author":"郭廑","text":"澄江晚悠悠，离思杳难极。\n西风鸿雁飞，我忆鸣秋客。\n远树带馀晖，前川起寒色。\n即此待归舟，沙头扫苔石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挹翠轩","author":"郭廑","text":"幽轩多雅趣，境静绝浮埃。\n树色开帘入，山光引幔来。\n人閒啼鸟近，风度落花回。\n消尽尘中想，弥深物外怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人之京","author":"郭廑","text":"况我悲寥落，怜君又北迁。\n春归万里外，人去五云边。\n塞柳迎征旆，江花照别筵。\n离情杂秋思，分袂各悽然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日登九华观","author":"郭廑","text":"楼台三岛外，钟磬五云端。\n入谷仙源迥，攀萝鸟道难。\n泉声丹灶冷，花影玉笙寒。\n坐觉天风起，神游极渺漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和梅轩来韵","author":"郭廑","text":"怜君得佳趣，芳树掩衡门。\n对酒花成坞，题诗竹满轩。\n湖光孤棹晚，山影半帘昏。\n后夜藤萝月，相思入梦魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33863,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过陈氏园亭","author":"郭廑","text":"高士园林好，岩扉昼不扃。\n绝胜陶令巷，犹是子云亭。\n幔卷飞泉白，窗含远岫青。\n何时出尘想，来此共谈经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33864,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过黄希刚有作","author":"郭廑","text":"知君情不浅，携我兴何长。\n独下云边榻，同斟月下觞。\n秋吟看菊好，夕饮醉粳香。\n坐久忘归去，衣沾湖上霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33865,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"士琛家宴归赋以赠之","author":"郭廑","text":"我爱南湖客，清风两鬓丝。\n久闻陶令趣，长与远公期。\n醉倚花前石，行吟竹外池。\n葛巾仍不着，日日挂东篱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33866,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒真人宫","author":"郭廑","text":"夕到真仙境，清斋过竹房。\n梦回孤嶂月，寒入一襟霜。\n夜色神鳌起，秋声瑞鹤翔。\n披衣不重寐，缥缈识天香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33867,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和楚芳兄来韵","author":"郭廑","text":"天上青云迥，湖边白屋贫。\n不嫌栖此地，何幸接芳邻。\n草阁频邀月，萝衣岂负春。\n吾兄读书处，还有问奇人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33868,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄义屿黄甥","author":"郭廑","text":"沙头孤鹤立，吾命一丝牵。\n伏枕仍春夏，寻方废简编。\n猗兰山谷月，老树渭阳天。\n伯也如相问，频过话昔年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33869,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晖上人独坐亭","author":"郭廑","text":"石径通幽境，岩亭古木深。\n禅扉生晚翠，罗幌挂秋阴。\n止水空中性，孤云物外心。\n澹然无一事，残月下东林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33870,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚次乐乡县","author":"郭廑","text":"浮生同逆旅，扰扰几时休。\n雁影三湘梦，猿声五岭愁。\n异乡那见月，别路忽惊秋。\n明发云山路，征车岂暂留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33871,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过高盖定光庵","author":"郭廑","text":"不过兹庵久，行经自豁然。\n江涵空外屿，月映坐来禅。\n开凿非无地，经营别有天。\n定光光不灭，长照一峰前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33872,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹庵","author":"郭廑","text":"高士何年赋考槃，半庵脩竹带飞湍。\n窗迎嶰谷三春霁，幔捲湘潭五月寒。\n鹤立静依青翡翠，凤吟曾上碧琅玕。\n好期澹月凉云夕，曲尽瑶琴白雪弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33873,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]